<div class="dv-product">
  <div class="dv-product__images">
   {% render 'snippet.placeholder', size: 48 %}
  </div>
  <div class="dv-product__info">
    <p class="dv-product__name">Product name</p>
    <div class="dv-product__price">
      <span class="dv-product__compare-at">{{ 49.99 | money}}</span>
      <span class="dv-product__current-price">{{ 39.99 | money }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

{% comment %} 
  nothing will change from the product markup
  data attr to know which style is active
  for each style set the following css vars:
    - padding for the image
    - padding for the content
    - background of the card
    - gap of content and card
    - border radius of card
    - border radius of image
    - alignment of pricing (horizontal in minimal)


